================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

This project incorporates and modifies code from the following sources.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Project F Verilog Library — https://projectf.io
Copyright (c) 2021 Will Green
Released under the MIT License.

The drawing primitives derive from this library: draw_line.sv,
draw_rectangle_fill.sv, draw_triangle_fill.sv, draw_polygon.sv and
draw_rectangle.sv. draw_quad.sv is an extension of Project F's rectangle
module, generalised to arbitrary quadrilaterals. Modifications were made for
compatibility with the DE1-SoC VGA adapter.

The line algorithm follows "The Beauty of Bresenham's Algorithm" by Alois
Zingl — http://members.chello.at/~easyfilter/bresenham.html

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DE1-SoC VGA Adapter
University of Toronto / Terasic reference components, provided as course
infrastructure: vga_adapter.v, vga_controller.v, vga_address_translator.v and
the PLL. These are redistributed as supplied; refer to their own file headers
for terms.
